# 📜 RULE — Canon 4-Layer Local Production Flow

> **Authority**: GOPIA://olym.constitution.v1 (Article V: Audit & Accountability)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/canon-production-flow.ail`

---

## R-CPF-1 — 4 Layer là BẤT BIẾN

```yaml
production_layers:
  - id: 1
    name: "Forge Layer (Source Forge)"
    fap_root: "ha:/"
    rrp_root: "t:/hace/"
    role: "SOURCE_OF_TRUTH"
    operations: ["forge", "build", "refine", "patch", "fix", "refactor"]
    output: ["engine_parts", "fem", "nep", "nap", "artifacts", "reference_impl"]
    may_create_source: true
  - id: 2
    name: "CAW Layer (Crystallize Assemble Warehouse)"
    fap_root: "caw:/"
    rrp_root: "t:/caw/"
    role: "CRYSTALLIZE_FACTORY"
    operations: ["import", "assemble", "integrate", "test", "verify", "crystallize"]
    output: ["semi_engine", "secondary_product", "provider_artifact"]
    may_create_source: false
  - id: 3
    name: "Workspace Layer (Final Product)"
    fap_root: "ws:/"
    rrp_root: "t:/workspaces/"
    role: "PRODUCT_ASSEMBLY"
    operations: ["import", "assemble", "customize", "integrate", "configure", "package"]
    output: ["final_product", "application", "program", "service"]
    may_create_source: false
  - id: 4
    name: "Distribution Layer (Cloud)"
    fap_root: "gh:/"
    rrp_root: "(github.com/cosda-dev, github.com/hugaalfatech)"
    role: "DISTRIBUTION"
    operations: ["push", "publish", "release", "tag"]
    output: ["public_repo", "crate", "milky_bundle"]
```

## R-CPF-2 — Mệnh đề bất biến

> **Forge builds the parts.**
> **CAW crystallizes the engines.**
> **Workspace assembles the products.**
> **GitHub distributes.**

KHÔNG layer nào được phép:
- Forge tạo final application
- CAW tạo source engine mới
- Workspace tạo engine parts
- Distribution chứa private runtime key

## R-CPF-3 — Source of Truth Hierarchy

```yaml
source_of_truth_order:
  1: "ha:/engine/*            # Read-only từ CAW/Workspace"
  2: "gh:cosda-dev/*          # Mirror, fast access"
  3: "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym # Olym canonical mirror"
  4: "crates.io               # Upstream fallback"
  5: "caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor/  # Local fast cache"
```

Khi có conflict, layer SAU (cao hơn trong list) được coi là authority.

## R-CPF-4 — Cogninfer Actor Development Loop

```text
1. IMPORT
   ha:/engine/*  (read-only)
        ↓
2. ASSEMBLE
   caw:/minispace/{ws}
        ↓
3. CHECK
   cargo check
        ↓
4. TEST
   scripts/ + tests/
        ↓
5. ERROR?
   ├── NO  → CRYSTALLIZE → caw artifact
   └── YES → DIAGNOSE → FORGE (ha:/engine/*)
                  ↓
            patch / fix / refactor
                  ↓
            re-run caw
                  ↓
            PASS → PUSH gh:cosda-dev/* + gh:hugaalfatech/*
```

## R-CPF-5 — Cross-Layer Hand-off (BẮT BUỘC 1-CHIỀU)

```yaml
handoff_direction: "ha → caw → ws → gh"   # chỉ đi tới, KHÔNG đi lùi
exception: "diagnose → forge (ha)"         # CHỈ diagnose mới được up-stream
no_reverse_modify: true                    # ws không sửa caw, caw không sửa ha
```

## R-CPF-6 — Cite Source

Mọi Cogninfer Actor khi report kết quả PHẢI cite layer gốc:

```yaml
report_format:
  layer_origin: "ha:/hace/engine/rr/actor/text-ractor"
  layer_action: "caw:/minispace/ws-hace-actors (assemble)"
  layer_output: "caw:/minispace/ws-hace-actors/release/actor.wasm"
  actor_id: "<agent>"
  timestamp: "<iso8601>"
```

